							     </TR>
	
								 <TR>
							  	  	 <TD WIDTH=192>
									 	 <P><b>July 20th, 2003</b>
										 <br>Went to take pictures of my Jeep for my
										 Grandparents who loaned me some money to
										 buy it.
									 </TD>
								  	 <TD WIDTH=192><a href="pictures/7-20-2003/7-20-2003_4.jpg"><img src="pictures/7-20-2003/t7-20-2003_4.jpg" width="192" height="144" alt="" border="0"></a></TD>
